{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2025-01", "window": 1, "start_date": 1735689600, "end_date": 1736380799, "month_true_total": 394, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:08:16 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "185130587", "author": {"steamid": "76561198244709948", "personaname": "剑客", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198244709948/", "num_games_owned": 589, "num_reviews": 43, "playtime_forever": 4291, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3078, "last_played": 1765565644, "avatar": "c8148e6efbf64fd70dd09fc77095cf5c60c93bfe"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "求生之路精神续作，画面更好、手感更棒。\r\n玩法上加入了卡牌系统，更有深度，更耐玩。\r\n缺点也是有的，没创意工坊，玩不了第三方地图。\r\n卡牌需要肝补给点和骷髅点数，嫌麻烦直接修改器刷吧。\r\n因为卡牌系统的缘故，玩家上下限差距很大，野排队友比较坑的时候就很坐牢，所以最好是和朋友们一起玩。", "timestamp_created": 1736363852, "timestamp_updated": 1736363852, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.514588356018066406", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185109804", "author": {"steamid": "76561198360011016", "personaname": "恍惚程", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198360011016/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 14710, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2348, "last_played": 1759166794, "avatar": "451ccdb1c76ae596936733635355eedf46833504"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "打折时入就是神作，否则 不推荐。", "timestamp_created": 1736346707, "timestamp_updated": 1736346707, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185108361", "author": {"steamid": "76561198428387283", "personaname": "𝔼𝕥𝕖𝕣𝕟𝕒𝕝", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198428387283/", "num_games_owned": 92, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 508, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 408, "last_played": 1777110924, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "没推击真玩不来，小僵尸比特感还猛，光污染地图看的我想呕吐，四十块玩了六小时，像坐牢一样，恶心至极。", "timestamp_created": 1736345632, "timestamp_updated": 1736352935, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185106592", "author": {"steamid": "76561199167959377", "personaname": "****** killer", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199167959377/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 3829, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1850, "last_played": 1773991322, "avatar": "d4e59dbc156a748bdde19aed02dfba0c6ff2aff1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "爽游", "timestamp_created": 1736344063, "timestamp_updated": 1736344063, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185105577", "author": {"steamid": "76561199324761204", "personaname": "一眼丁真", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199324761204/", "num_games_owned": 3, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 2693, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2514, "last_played": 1758380741, "avatar": "5500e6fdac5a20798f4d619a4ebf04ea61f9968b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "正常买只有四章能玩，还有两章战役需要购买DLC。服务器做的跟狗屎一样，没加速器分分钟给你服务器连接断开。就这品质跟价格不如L4D2一根。\r\n还开反作弊，让你不肝就别想拿完服装跟枪械皮肤。我还是不明白你一个买断制的游戏上反作弊意义何在", "timestamp_created": 1736343198, "timestamp_updated": 1736343198, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185100814", "author": {"steamid": "76561198424712449", "personaname": "E = mc2", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198424712449/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 191, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 191, "last_played": 1735746602, "avatar": "dbab3aa3feebeef65c2f287b07bbb673eaa9ca56"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "跟求生之路差不多  萌新玩单机不知道往哪走  在线模式遇到会玩的只能全程跟着跑   跟丢了很容易找不到路被围住   有的还不停催   体验极差\r\n这类游戏玩不下去基本都这个原因", "timestamp_created": 1736338549, "timestamp_updated": 1736338549, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185100718", "author": {"steamid": "76561199161694561", "personaname": "吉首一中老吃家", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199161694561/", "num_games_owned": 145, "num_reviews": 32, "playtime_forever": 444, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 229, "last_played": 1737375254, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "其实玩起来还可以，枪械手感蛮不错的，其次就是卡片的随机机制设计的还行，各种卡牌组合搭配面对不同的特感变异者怪物和大堆的尸潮时有着很独特有效的作用，看自己自身如何搭配卡牌应对处理。各个人物也有自己的技能点，看自己喜欢哪类，是喜欢枪械还是近战，或者团队协助。怪物模型设计和技能特点方面也算的上有点创新，但是很多技能都是借鉴和搬运了求生之路里面特感的技能招式。缺点的话一方面是没用创意工坊，可能很多玩家与ai队友组队打完所有战役后就觉得不需要再游玩了，缺乏大量的第三方民间地图。还有个就是优化真心不怎么样，我在游玩过程中，电脑风扇一直在转动。我笔记本配置还算好的，3050显卡加上锐龙处理器，但是优化真不怎么样，而且开的画质设置方面还是一般设置，没有高画质。还有就是制作组好像已经官宣不再更新游戏内容了，真的扎实。建议打折时候买，不建议原价入手。", "timestamp_created": 1736338448, "timestamp_updated": 1736338448, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "185099865", "author": {"steamid": "76561199748974216", "personaname": "LeonRom", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199748974216/", "num_games_owned": 63, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 12073, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7036, "last_played": 1765203682, "avatar": "1149fef9ea8439558379ab1d1436225db50b4650"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "玩法新颖，求生之路的升阶版本，但是缺点也是比较多的，特别是游戏的优化很差，很多bug会导致闪退，在加上一个小蓝熊，真的可以说dbuff叠满了\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1736337599, "timestamp_updated": 1736337599, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}